<XuiHtmlElement>
<Properties>
<Id>XuiHtmlElement1</Id>
<Width>544.000000</Width>
<Height>312.000000</Height>
<Position>24.000000,56.000000,0.000000</Position>
<Text>&lt;font color="#000000" size=11&gt;

Several control types have &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Presenter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; versions associated with them.
These special controls are used within a skin file in order to create instance level differences between each control.

&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;

For instance, a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; for a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Button&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; would typically include a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Text Presenter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; and an &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Image Presenter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;.
Each &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Presenter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; will ask its parent control for the appropriate text or image path.
The &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Button&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; then has properties associated with each instance, which provide the data to the appropriate &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Presenter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;.
This allows you to specify a different image path and text whenever you place a new &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Button&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; control into a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scene&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;.

&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font size=8&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;
&lt;td width="86%" bgcolor="#808080"&gt;

&lt;font size=5&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;font color="#FFFFFF" size=10&gt;

Each &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Presenter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; variation has a 'DataAssociation' property that allows you to work with multiples of the same type of &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Presenter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; within a single &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;.
This would be how you could create a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Button&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; that has two defined images instead of just one.

&lt;font size=5&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;/font&gt;

</Text>
</Properties>
</XuiHtmlElement>
